  "_doc": "The Slagborn overseer who drives the captive diggers. P1 \"Work Faster\": a whip that reaches far (a line), a chain that pins you (root), and a kick. A loaded ore cart stands at the top of the rails: pull its brake (a lever, once) and it runs down the gallery and smashes into him — if he is standing on the rails. P2 at 50% \"Call the Gang\": he whistles up raiders and hides behind them (a shield that drops when they are dead).",
